{"schema":"mao-cross-channel-public-site-data/1","script":"0261","rows":[{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0261:000000ff:text","row":35839,"ordinal":1,"kind":"text","jp":"目を覚ます。","en":"I woke up.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900604","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4002:00001","en":"I am awake.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0261:00000123:text","row":35840,"ordinal":2,"kind":"text","jp":"陽光が窓を貫いていた。","en":"Sunlight speared through the window.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900605","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4002:00002","en":"Sunlight was piercing through the window.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0261:00000151:text","row":35841,"ordinal":3,"kind":"text","jp":"熟睡していたらしい。夢一つ見なかった。","en":"Apparently I'd slept like a log. Not a single dream.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900606","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4002:00003","en":"Seems I have been hard asleep. I did not have any dreams.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0261:0000018f:text","row":35842,"ordinal":4,"kind":"text","jp":"時間は……７時。","en":"It was... seven.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900607","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4002:00004","en":"The time is... 7AM.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0261:000001b7:text","row":35843,"ordinal":5,"kind":"text","jp":"学校に行く必要などない。","en":"There was no need to go to school.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900608","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4002:00005","en":"There's no need to go to school or anything.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0261:000001e7:text","row":35844,"ordinal":6,"kind":"text","jp":"けど、体は動いた。","en":"But my body moved anyway.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900609","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4002:00006","en":"Yet, the body moved.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0261:000002e9:text","row":35845,"ordinal":7,"kind":"text","jp":"朝食の用意はされていない。","en":"There was no breakfast waiting for me.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900610","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4002:00007","en":"Breakfast was not served.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0261:0000031b:text","row":35846,"ordinal":8,"kind":"text","jp":"当然か。","en":"Of course not.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900611","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4002:00008","en":"Of course.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0261:0000033b:text","row":35847,"ordinal":9,"kind":"text","jp":"美人でキャリアな睦美おばさんは料理もうまいが、もういない。","en":"Aunt Mutsumi had been beautiful, successful, and a fine cook too. But she was gone now.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900612","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4002:00009","en":"Career beauty Mutsumi-obasan and her cooking so delicious are no more.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0261:0000038d:text","row":35848,"ordinal":10,"kind":"text","jp":"引き取ってくれたこと。","en":"She had taken me in.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900613","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4002:00010","en":"She had taken custody of me,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0261:000003bb:text","row":35849,"ordinal":11,"kind":"text","jp":"曜子ちゃんとのことを、穏便に取りはからってくれたこと……。","en":"She had handled the trouble between Youko and me without a scene...","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900614","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4002:00011","en":"and she had amicably taken care of that thing with Youko-chan...","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0261:0000040d:text","row":35850,"ordinal":12,"kind":"text","jp":"感謝はいくらでもできた。","en":"I could have thanked her forever.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900615","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4002:00012","en":"I had an indefinite amount of appreciation to give.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0261:0000043d:text","row":35851,"ordinal":13,"kind":"text","jp":"孝行する前に、消失してしまった。","en":"And she had disappeared before I could do anything for her in return.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900616","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4002:00013","en":"But before I could show filial piety, she had disappeared.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0261:00000475:text","row":35852,"ordinal":14,"kind":"text","jp":"この家にまともな食い物はない。","en":"There was nothing decent to eat in the house.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900617","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4002:00014","en":"There's nothing decent to eat in this house.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0261:000004ab:text","row":35853,"ordinal":15,"kind":"text","jp":"水だけ飲んだ。","en":"All I had was water.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900618","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4002:00015","en":"I just drank water.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0261:000005b4:text","row":35854,"ordinal":16,"kind":"text","jp":"この道で、よく遊紗ちゃんと出会った。","en":"I used to run into Yusa on this road all the time.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900619","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4002:00016","en":"I often met with Yusa-chan on this road.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0261:000005f0:text","row":35855,"ordinal":17,"kind":"text","jp":"よくなついていた。","en":"She’d really taken to me.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900620","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4002:00017","en":"She took to me well.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0261:0000061a:text","row":35856,"ordinal":18,"kind":"text","jp":"こそばゆい、存在だった。","en":"Her affection left me oddly self-conscious.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900621","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4002:00018","en":"She was this ticklish being...","verdict":"questionable","categories":["idiom_calque","undertranslation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0261:0000064a:text","row":35857,"ordinal":19,"kind":"text","jp":"今の俺ができるまで、俺もいろいろ苦労している。","en":"I'd had my share of hardship becoming who I was.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900622","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4002:00019","en":"I too went through so much hardship to become what I am now,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0261:00000690:text","row":35858,"ordinal":20,"kind":"text","jp":"遊紗ちゃんの存在は、よく俺を癒してくれた。","en":"Having Yusa around had often been a comfort.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900623","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4002:00020","en":"and the presence of Yusa-chan soothed me so much.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0261:000006d2:text","row":35859,"ordinal":21,"kind":"text","jp":"そんな彼女ももういない。","en":"And now she was gone too.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900624","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4002:00021","en":"That girl is also no more.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0261:00000788:text","row":35860,"ordinal":22,"kind":"text","jp":"「よう」","en":"“Hey.”","speakerJa":"桜庭","speakerEn":"Sakuraba","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900625","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4002:00022","en":"Sakuraba: \"Yo.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0261:000007ad:text","row":35861,"ordinal":23,"kind":"text","jp":"桜庭だった。","en":"It was Sakuraba.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900626","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4002:00023","en":"It was Sakuraba.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0261:000007d9:text","row":35862,"ordinal":24,"kind":"text","jp":"「よう」","en":"“Hey.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900627","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4002:00024","en":"Taichi: \"Yoh.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0261:00000830:text","row":35863,"ordinal":25,"kind":"text","jp":"「腹が減った」","en":"“I’m hungry.”","speakerJa":"桜庭","speakerEn":"Sakuraba","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900628","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4002:00025","en":"Sakuraba: \"Hungry.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0261:0000085e:text","row":35864,"ordinal":26,"kind":"text","jp":"「俺もだ」","en":"“Me too.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900629","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4002:00026","en":"Taichi: \"Me too.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0261:00000906:text","row":35865,"ordinal":27,"kind":"text","jp":"「おまえもか」","en":"“You too?”","speakerJa":"桜庭","speakerEn":"Sakuraba","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900630","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4002:00027","en":"Sakuraba: \"You too?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0261:00000934:text","row":35866,"ordinal":28,"kind":"text","jp":"「そうだ」","en":"“Yeah.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900631","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4002:00028","en":"Taichi: \"Indeed.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0261:000009dc:text","row":35867,"ordinal":29,"kind":"text","jp":"「切ないな」","en":"“That's depressing.”","speakerJa":"桜庭","speakerEn":"Sakuraba","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900632","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4002:00029","en":"Sakuraba: \"How trying.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0261:00000a08:text","row":35868,"ordinal":30,"kind":"text","jp":"「ああ、切ない」","en":"“Yeah. Depressing.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900633","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4002:00030","en":"Taichi: \"Yup, trying.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0261:00000a38:text","row":35869,"ordinal":31,"kind":"text","jp":"「こんな時、俺は一般家庭に突入する」","en":"“At times like this, I raid an ordinary family home.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900634","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4002:00031","en":"Taichi: \"Times like this, I just break into some ordinary home.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0261:00000bd0:text","row":35870,"ordinal":32,"kind":"text","jp":"手近に民家に突っ込む。","en":"I barged into the nearest house.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900635","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4002:00032","en":"I plunge into some residence nearby,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0261:00000cda:text","row":35871,"ordinal":33,"kind":"text","jp":"戻ってくる。","en":"A moment later, I returned.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900636","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4002:00033","en":"and return.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0261:00000d06:text","row":35872,"ordinal":34,"kind":"text","jp":"「大漁だったぞ」","en":"“Jackpot.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900637","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4002:00034","en":"Taichi: \"Got a big catch!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0261:00000d8f:text","row":35873,"ordinal":35,"kind":"text","jp":"保存食がたくさんあった。","en":"I'd found a stockpile of emergency rations.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900638","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4002:00035","en":"That place was decked with preserved food.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0261:00000dc7:text","row":35874,"ordinal":36,"kind":"text","jp":"「見ろ、カンパンだ。しかもこんぺいとうが入ってるやつだぞ」","en":"“Look—hardtack. And it's the kind that comes with little sugar stars.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900639","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4002:00036","en":"Taichi: \"Look at this, it's Kanpan. And it's one of those with Konpeitos in it too!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0261:00000e3e:text","row":35875,"ordinal":37,"kind":"text","jp":"「……ぐす」","en":"“...Sniff.”","speakerJa":"桜庭","speakerEn":"Sakuraba","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900640","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4002:00037","en":"Sakuraba: \"...sniff!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0261:00000e62:text","row":35876,"ordinal":38,"kind":"text","jp":"桜庭は鼻水を垂らしていた。","en":"Sakuraba's nose was running.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900641","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4002:00038","en":"Sakuraba had mucus dangling from the nose.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0261:00000e9c:text","row":35877,"ordinal":39,"kind":"text","jp":"「……避難していて正解だったようだ」","en":"“...Looks like they evacuated in time.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900642","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4002:00039","en":"Taichi: \"...looks like I was right to take refuge.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0261:00000f5e:text","row":35878,"ordinal":40,"kind":"text","jp":"「ティッシュを所望したいところだ」","en":"“I'd like a tissue.”","speakerJa":"桜庭","speakerEn":"Sakuraba","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900643","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4002:00040","en":"Sakuraba: \"I currently desire tissue.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0261:00000fa0:text","row":35879,"ordinal":41,"kind":"text","jp":"「ない」","en":"“Don't have any.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900644","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4002:00041","en":"Taichi: \"Got none.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0261:00000fe5:text","row":35880,"ordinal":42,"kind":"text","jp":"「……ん。なら仕方ないな」","en":"“...Hm. Can't be helped.”","speakerJa":"桜庭","speakerEn":"Sakuraba","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900645","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4002:00042","en":"Sakuraba: \"...hm. Then, nothing I can do.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0261:00001017:text","row":35881,"ordinal":43,"kind":"text","jp":"そのまま歩き出した。","en":"He kept walking.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900646","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4002:00043","en":"And he went to walk on as he was.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0261:00001043:text","row":35882,"ordinal":44,"kind":"text","jp":"つらら状に垂れた鼻水が、軽妙に左右に踊る。","en":"The icicle of snot under his nose danced jauntily from side to side.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900647","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4002:00044","en":"The snot, hanging like an icicle, lambently dances left and right.","verdict":"questionable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0261:0000108d:text","row":35883,"ordinal":45,"kind":"text","jp":"「仕方ないで済ますな！」","en":"“Don't just accept it!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900648","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4002:00045","en":"Taichi: \"Don't just settle this with a 'nothing I can do'!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0261:000010bd:text","row":35884,"ordinal":46,"kind":"text","jp":"ハンカチを出す。","en":"I pulled out my handkerchief.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900649","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4002:00046","en":"I take out my handkerchief.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0261:0000116b:text","row":35885,"ordinal":47,"kind":"text","jp":"「……すまん」","en":"“...Thanks.”","speakerJa":"桜庭","speakerEn":"Sakuraba","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900650","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4002:00047","en":"Sakuraba: \"...sorry.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0261:00001199:text","row":35886,"ordinal":48,"kind":"text","jp":"「返すなよ。絶対に返すなよ？　やるんだからな」","en":"“Don't give it back. Don't you dare give it back. I'm giving it to you.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900651","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4002:00048","en":"Taichi: \"Do not give this back! Absolutely do not give this back get it? I'll do you in if you do!\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation","logical_relation","addition"],"assessment":"The Japanese explains that he is giving Sakuraba the handkerchief outright, which is why it must not be returned. The English instead threatens to kill or attack him if he returns it.","remedy":"Don't return it. Absolutely don't return it, okay? I'm giving it to you.","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":98,"start":73,"text":"I'll do you in if you do!"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0261:00001204:text","row":35887,"ordinal":49,"kind":"text","jp":"「借りが出来た」","en":"“Now I owe you one.”","speakerJa":"桜庭","speakerEn":"Sakuraba","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900652","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4002:00049","en":"Sakuraba: \"I come into your debt.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0261:00001234:text","row":35888,"ordinal":50,"kind":"text","jp":"「それは返せよ」","en":"“That you do have to pay back.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900653","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4002:00050","en":"Taichi: \"That one you repay!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0261:000012e2:text","row":35889,"ordinal":51,"kind":"text","jp":"「うむ」","en":"“Right.”","speakerJa":"桜庭","speakerEn":"Sakuraba","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900654","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4002:00051","en":"Sakuraba: \"Yup.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]}]}
